        "line": 2,
        "text": "name: remotion-render"
      },
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "description: \"Render videos from React/Remotion component code via inference.sh. Pass TSX code, get MP4. Supports all Remotion APIs: useCurrentFrame, useVideoConfig, spring, interpolate, AbsoluteFill, Sequence. Configurable resolution, FPS, duration, codec. Use for: programmatic video generation, animated graphics, motion design, data-driven videos, React animations to video. Triggers: remotion, render video from code, tsx to video, react video, programmatic video, remotion render, code to video, animated video, motion graphics code, react animation video\""
      },
      {
        "line": 4,
        "text": "allowed-tools: Bash(belt *)"
      },
      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": "> **Install the belt CLI skill:** `npx skills add belt-sh/cli`"
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": "# Remotion Render"
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "Render videos from React/Remotion component code via [inference.sh](https://inference.sh) CLI."
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": "![Remotion Render](https://cloud.inference.sh/app/files/u/4mg21r6ta37mpaz6ktzwtt8krr/01kg2c0egyg243mnyth4y6g51q.jpeg)"
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "## Quick Start"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "> Requires inference.sh CLI (`belt`). [Install instructions](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/inference-sh/skills/refs/heads/main/cli-install.md)"
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "```bash"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "belt login"
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": "# Render a simple animation"
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "belt app run infsh/remotion-render --input '{"
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "  \"code\": \"import { useCurrentFrame, AbsoluteFill } from \\\"remotion\\\"; export default function Main() { const frame = useCurrentFrame(); return <AbsoluteFill style={{backgroundColor: \\\"#000\\\", display: \\\"flex\\\", justifyContent: \\\"center\\\", alignItems: \\\"center\\\"}}><h1 style={{color: \\\"white\\\", fontSize: 100, opacity: frame / 30}}>Hello World</h1></AbsoluteFill>; }\","
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "  \"duration_seconds\": 3,"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": "  \"fps\": 30,"
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": "  \"width\": 1920,"
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "  \"height\": 1080"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "}'"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "## Input Schema"
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |"
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "|-----------|------|----------|-------------|"
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "| `code` | string | Yes | React component TSX code. Must export default a component. |"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": "| `composition_id` | string | No | Composition ID to render |"
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "| `props` | object | No | Props passed to the component |"
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "| `width` | number | No | Video width in pixels |"
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "| `height` | number | No | Video height in pixels |"
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "| `fps` | number | No | Frames per second |"
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "| `duration_seconds` | number | No | Video duration in seconds |"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": "| `codec` | string | No | Output codec |"
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "## Available Imports"
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": "Your TSX code can import from `remotion` and `react`:"
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": "```tsx"
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": "// Remotion APIs"
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": "import {"
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "  useCurrentFrame,"
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": "  useVideoConfig,"
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": "  spring,"
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": "  interpolate,"
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": "  AbsoluteFill,"
      },
      {
        "line": 58,
        "text": "  Sequence,"
      },
      {
        "line": 59,
        "text": "  Audio,"
      },
      {
        "line": 60,
        "text": "  Video,"
      },
      {
        "line": 61,
        "text": "  Img"
      },
      {
        "line": 62,
        "text": "} from \"remotion\";"
      },
      {
        "line": 63,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 64,
        "text": "// React"
      },
      {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "import React, { useState, useEffect } from \"react\";"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": "## Examples"
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 70,
        "text": "### Fade-In Text"
      },
      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": "```bash"
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "belt app run infsh/remotion-render --input '{"
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": "  \"code\": \"import { useCurrentFrame, AbsoluteFill, interpolate } from \\\"remotion\\\"; export default function Main() { const frame = useCurrentFrame(); const opacity = interpolate(frame, [0, 30], [0, 1]); return <AbsoluteFill style={{backgroundColor: \\\"#1a1a2e\\\", display: \\\"flex\\\", justifyContent: \\\"center\\\", alignItems: \\\"center\\\"}}><h1 style={{color: \\\"#eee\\\", fontSize: 80, opacity}}>Welcome</h1></AbsoluteFill>; }\","
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": "  \"duration_seconds\": 2,"
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": "  \"fps\": 30,"
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": "  \"width\": 1920,"
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "  \"height\": 1080"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": "}'"
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "### Animated Counter"
      },
      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": "```bash"
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": "belt app run infsh/remotion-render --input '{"
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "  \"code\": \"import { useCurrentFrame, useVideoConfig, AbsoluteFill } from \\\"remotion\\\"; export default function Main() { const frame = useCurrentFrame(); const { fps, durationInFrames } = useVideoConfig(); const progress = Math.floor((frame / durationInFrames) * 100); return <AbsoluteFill style={{backgroundColor: \\\"#000\\\", display: \\\"flex\\\", justifyContent: \\\"center\\\", alignItems: \\\"center\\\", flexDirection: \\\"column\\\"}}><h1 style={{color: \\\"#fff\\\", fontSize: 200}}>{progress}%</h1><p style={{color: \\\"#666\\\", fontSize: 30}}>Loading...</p></AbsoluteFill>; }\","
      },
      {
